{"id":"4176ebfcf797c869","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-critical-pair.md","title":"临界对","display":"df-critical-pair — 临界对","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"definition","label":"56-df-critical-pair","aliases":["56-df-critical-pair"],"display":"df-critical-pair — 临界对","depends_on":["[[56-df-overlap]]","[[56-df-mgu]]","[[56-df-replace]]","[[56-df-rewrite-system]]"],"source_section":"§2.7 Definition 2.7.9; Lemma 2.7.12","source_printed_pages":"53–54","source_ocr_blocks":[74,75],"source_verification":"原书OCR文本陈述已逐项比对；证明核验范围见Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-critical-pair"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-critical-pair</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-critical-pair — 临界对"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8d38c305aa30cc4d\" href=\"?note=8d38c305aa30cc4d\" title=\"56-df-overlap\">56-df-overlap</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5252b28de1f68970\" href=\"?note=5252b28de1f68970\" title=\"56-df-mgu\">56-df-mgu</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b58d01262349aaf3\" href=\"?note=b58d01262349aaf3\" title=\"56-df-replace\">56-df-replace</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§2.7 Definition 2.7.9; Lemma 2.7.12"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"53–54"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>74</span><span>75</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"原书OCR文本陈述已逐项比对；证明核验范围见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span> 和规则集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a>；这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,V\">\\(F,V\\)</span> 分别实例化上游的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F,\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_0,\\rho_1\\in\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(\\rho_0,\\rho_1\\in\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t,u,v\\in T\">\\(s,t,u,v\\in T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq T^2\">\\(C\\subseteq T^2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Variant}\">\\(\\mathrm{Variant}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8d38c305aa30cc4d\" href=\"?note=8d38c305aa30cc4d\" title=\"56-df-overlap\">56-df-overlap</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ApartVariants}\">\\(\\mathrm{ApartVariants}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8d38c305aa30cc4d\" href=\"?note=8d38c305aa30cc4d\" title=\"56-df-overlap\">56-df-overlap</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MGU}\">\\(\\mathrm{MGU}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5252b28de1f68970\" href=\"?note=5252b28de1f68970\" title=\"56-df-mgu\">56-df-mgu</a>，替换子项见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b58d01262349aaf3\" href=\"?note=b58d01262349aaf3\" title=\"56-df-replace\">56-df-replace</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CPBetween}(\\Sigma,V,\\rho_0,\\rho_1):=\n\\{(l_0\\sigma[r_1\\sigma]_p,r_0\\sigma):{}&amp;\n(l_0,r_0),(l_1,r_1)\\in T^2,\\;\n\\mathrm{ApartVariants}(\\Sigma,V,\\rho_0,\\rho_1,(l_0,r_0),(l_1,r_1)),\\\\\n&amp;p\\in\\mathrm{Pos}(l_0),\\;l_0|_p\\notin V,\\;\n\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{MGU}(l_0|_p,l_1),\\;\n(\\rho_0\\neq\\rho_1\\lor p\\neq\\epsilon)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CPBetween}(\\Sigma,V,\\rho_0,\\rho_1):=\n\\{(l_0\\sigma[r_1\\sigma]_p,r_0\\sigma):{}&amp;\n(l_0,r_0),(l_1,r_1)\\in T^2,\\;\n\\mathrm{ApartVariants}(\\Sigma,V,\\rho_0,\\rho_1,(l_0,r_0),(l_1,r_1)),\\\\\n&amp;p\\in\\mathrm{Pos}(l_0),\\;l_0|_p\\notin V,\\;\n\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{MGU}(l_0|_p,l_1),\\;\n(\\rho_0\\neq\\rho_1\\lor p\\neq\\epsilon)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CP}(\\Sigma,V,R):=\n\\bigcup_{(\\rho_0,\\rho_1)\\in R\\times R}\\mathrm{CPBetween}(\\Sigma,V,\\rho_0,\\rho_1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CP}(\\Sigma,V,R):=\n\\bigcup_{(\\rho_0,\\rho_1)\\in R\\times R}\\mathrm{CPBetween}(\\Sigma,V,\\rho_0,\\rho_1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CPBasis}(\\Sigma,V,R,C)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n|C|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land C\\subseteq\\mathrm{CP}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\land\n\\forall(s,t)\\in\\mathrm{CP}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\;\\exists(u,v)\\in C\\;\n\\mathrm{Variant}(\\Sigma,V,(u,v),(s,t)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CPBasis}(\\Sigma,V,R,C)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n|C|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land C\\subseteq\\mathrm{CP}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\land\n\\forall(s,t)\\in\\mathrm{CP}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\;\\exists(u,v)\\in C\\;\n\\mathrm{Variant}(\\Sigma,V,(u,v),(s,t)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>临界对顺序与原书相同：先内红项收缩结果，再外红项收缩结果。本定义收集所有变元分离改名和所有MGU代表，故没有不合法的单值mgu选择；原书称临界对在改名意义下唯一。原书mgci构造与这里的变元分离MGU构造在改名下对应；CPBasis另外给出有限改名代表族的精确条件，供有限临界对完备化状态使用；有限规则集每对左端只有有限个位置，每个可合一重叠的MGU结果在改名意义下唯一，因此存在这种有限基。这里没有实现规范代表选择或枚举算法。核对了陈述，并核对Lemma 2.7.12说明任意重叠峰是临界对的替换实例。</p>\n<p>来源定位中的 <code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 指本地提取文本的页块序号，不宣称是DjVu物理页码；印刷页已按该页页眉或页脚核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-overlap","status":"resolved","id":"8d38c305aa30cc4d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-overlap]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-mgu","status":"resolved","id":"5252b28de1f68970","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-mgu]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-replace","status":"resolved","id":"b58d01262349aaf3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-replace]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"a6c29a8d098ef0ed","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"a6c29a8d098ef0ed","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$、$V$、$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$ 和规则集 $R$ 满足 $\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)$，见 [[56-df-rewrite-system]]；这里 $F,V$ 分别实例化上游的 $\\mathcal F,\\mathcal V$。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-overlap","status":"resolved","id":"8d38c305aa30cc4d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","headin