tex":"\\mathrm{CP}(\\Sigma,V,R):=\n\\bigcup_{(\\rho_0,\\rho_1)\\in R\\times R}\\mathrm{CPBetween}(\\Sigma,V,\\rho_0,\\rho_1).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CPBasis}(\\Sigma,V,R,C)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n|C|<\\aleph_0\\land C\\subseteq\\mathrm{CP}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\land\n\\forall(s,t)\\in\\mathrm{CP}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\;\\exists(u,v)\\in C\\;\n\\mathrm{Variant}(\\Sigma,V,(u,v),(s,t)).","display":true}],"bytes":2564,"backlinks":[{"id":"00208e314088402a","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CPBetween}$ 见 [[56-df-critical-pair]]，项对同时改名谓词 $\\mathrm{Variant}$ 见 [[56-df-overlap]]。$\\mathrm{NF}$ 与 $\\to_P^*$ 分别见 [[56-df-normal-form]]、[[56-df-rewrite-relation-transitive]]。以下辅助函数的规则参数 $P\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,V))$，$\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Rule}(\\Sigma,V)$，$C\\subseteq T^2$，$s,u\\in T$；这些局部参数不限制候选状态 $R,R'$。"},{"id":"dc58a5d9b4b80518","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LeftLinear}$ 见 [[56-df-left-linear]]，$\\mathrm{CP}$ 见 [[56-df-critical-pair]]。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-67","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-critical-pair.md]]"},{"id":"dcc1e9c43059f569","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"CP、局部合流、可汇合见 [[56-df-critical-pair]]、[[56-df-locally-confluent]]、[[56-df-joinable]]。"},{"id":"e6a39a4f73051784","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"SN、合流、CP、Join见 [[56-df-strongly-normalizing]]、[[56-df-confluent]]、[[56-df-critical-pair]]、[[56-df-joinable]]；两引理见 [[56-thm-critical-pair-lemma]]、[[56-thm-newman-lemma]]。"}],"outgoing":["8d38c305aa30cc4d","5252b28de1f68970","b58d01262349aaf3","a6c29a8d098ef0ed"]}